NOTE:Texts sent from your Lurie Children's Emergency Care Team. 🫶\n\nIf you'd like to talk\, you can always call or text 988 to speak with Crisis Lifeline counselors\, or you can call the Illinois CARES hotline at 1-800-345-9049. 💙\n\nIf you’d like to change the time of day you receive these texts\, or if you don’t want to receive future texts\, email HoffmannLab@luriechildrens.org.\n\nRemember\, you matter.
